   $q$How does paragraph 4 help develop the author's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It introduces a new benefit of trees that the author has not mentioned before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-structure"},{"text":"It proves that tree roots never damage sidewalks when they are cared for well.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"},{"text":"It admits the costs of trees, then explains why the benefits can outweigh them.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It changes the author's position, showing that trees may not be worth the cost.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It admits the costs of trees, then explains why the benefits can outweigh them.$q$, $q$Paragraph 4 says "These concerns are real," then explains that good planning prevents most damage and savings can outweigh costs. It says "most damage," not that roots never cause damage, and the author keeps the same position.$q$, 'draft', 'abd3c31b-7e60-51cd-83cb-8c41abc222c2')
