  ('be972a3b-a209-57c5-a077-4645899d3a47', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-context-clues'), null, 'medium',
   $q$In paragraph 5, Leila's notes sound "dissonant." What does "dissonant" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"soft and hard to hear","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"harsh and out of harmony","is_correct":true},{"text":"smooth and pleasing","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"quick and rushed","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-context-clue"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$harsh and out of harmony$q$, $q$The words right after it restate the meaning: "harsh and clashing instead of smooth," and Sami covers his ears. "Smooth" is what the notes are not, so "smooth and pleasing" is the opposite.$q$, 'draft', '51d8dfb9-ead2-5b85-b7d0-725d6669dde5')
