  ('ff676030-d45d-5a45-9a54-e4c1b0445b08', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-context-clues'), null, 'easy',
   $q$According to paragraph 1, what are "aqueducts"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"tall bridges built with arches","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"public fountains in the streets","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"deep wells dug inside the city","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-context-clue"},{"text":"long channels that carried water","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$long channels that carried water$q$, $q$The sentence defines aqueducts as "long channels that carried water into the city." The arched bridges were only one part of an aqueduct, as paragraph 3 explains, so that choice is too narrow.$q$, 'draft', 'a98ba625-18e8-5214-9b7f-88deae86109f')
