  ('4a19d2fd-3673-5d5e-a2d0-960ffbaf036f', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-context-clues'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The author says 3D printers are "remarkably versatile." Based on the examples in paragraph 4, what does "versatile" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"very expensive to buy and to repair","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"able to work much faster than people","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-context-clue"},{"text":"able to be used for many different things","is_correct":true},{"text":"small enough to carry from room to room","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unrelated-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$able to be used for many different things$q$, $q$The examples, a stove knob, a dinosaur skull model, a pencil grip, and heart models, are all very different, so versatile means useful for many purposes. Speed is discussed in paragraph 3, not in the examples that explain this word.$q$, 'draft', '867e0745-bfe3-55a8-8ef4-be94739c2cfe')
