   $q$In paragraph 3, pigeons were "fast and dependable." Which word is closest in meaning to "dependable"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"careless","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"antonym-confusion"},{"text":"reliable","is_correct":true},{"text":"friendly","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unrelated-meaning"},{"text":"speedy","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-nearby-word"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$reliable$q$, $q$Something dependable can be counted on, which is what "reliable" means. "Speedy" describes the word "fast" that comes just before it, not "dependable."$q$, 'draft', '1f1ed3c4-411a-5394-b541-ca3671e3ad70')
